      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/mount_vernon_maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Mount Vernon Place Flower Mart, held annually since 1911, draws locals and visitors alike to a colorful celebration of blooms.",
