      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Key landmarks include the Walters Art Museum, Enoch Pratt Free Library, Maryland Center for History and Culture, and the Basilica of the Assumption, the oldest U.S. cathedral.",
